  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for xen",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for xen fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-62437: x86: DMs may cause mem leak by IRQ binding (bsc#1276838).\n- CVE-2026-79602: x86: improper handling of HVM emulation return codes (bsc#1276839).\n- CVE-2026-79603: unconditionally do TLB flushing ahead of page scrubbing (bsc#1276841).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
